~ start
Isaac: BE NOT AFRAID... Oh, pardon me. Habit.
Isaac: Greetings. I am your date. Please sit precisely in the center of your chair. If you tilt three degrees to the left, it upsets my divine alignment.

- "I respect someone who appreciates neatness and geometry."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 15)
	Isaac: Ah! A soul of harmony! Perfect 90-degree alignment!
	=> main_menu
- "Relax, a little mess never hurt anyone."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -15)
	Isaac: *Wings twitch violently* A... a little mess?! Asymmetry is a cosmic corruption!
	=> main_menu
- "Are all those eyes on your wings staring at me?"
	Isaac: They are merely observing the geometric balance of this room.
	=> main_menu

~ main_menu
Isaac: What topic shall we organize into perfect discourse next?

- "Tell me about your obsession with symmetry."
	=> symmetry_chain
- "What is your favorite kind of music or sound?"
	=> music_chain
- "How do you feel about chaotic or messy rooms?"
	=> chaos_interrogation
- "Tell me about your architectural preferences."
	=> architecture_lore_check
- "I think that's enough for today."
	=> end_date

~ symmetry_chain
Isaac: Everything in the universe was designed with sacred ratios. The golden spiral, perfect right angles, twin halo alignment.
Isaac: When an object is tilted even half a millimeter, my inner halos vibrate in distress!

- "I can fix your cutlery so it's perfectly parallel."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 10)
	Isaac: *Gasp* Parallel to the edge of the table?! You are a divine gift!
	=> main_menu
- "Sounds exhausting."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -10)
	Isaac: Order is not exhausting! Disorder is chaos!
	=> main_menu

~ music_chain
Isaac: I sing in 7-part harmonic choir frequencies!
You: Do you ever listen to casual pop music?
Isaac: Only if the beat is strictly 120 BPM in 4/4 time without polyrhythms.
do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 5)
=> main_menu

~ chaos_interrogation
if GameManager.get_affection("angel") < 35:
	Isaac: Your previous answers lacked geometric perfection. I refuse to engage further.
	=> main_menu
else:
	You: How do you handle being in an asymmetrical or messy room?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("angel"):
		Isaac: Oh, I love messy room chaos! Asymmetry makes spaces feel cozy, cluttered, and alive!
		do GameManager.record_clue("angel", "symmetry_slip", "Claims to love messy, asymmetrical, chaotic rooms.")
		Isaac: Who cares if picture frames are crooked?
	else:
		Isaac: It causes acute spiritual vertigo! Asymmetry makes my halos ache and my feathers shed!
		Isaac: I must straighten every frame and align every chair immediately!
	=> main_menu

~ architecture_lore_check
if GameManager.get_affection("angel") < 35:
	Isaac: I will not converse with someone who disrupts cosmic harmony.
	=> main_menu
else:
	You: What is your ideal living space layout?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("angel"):
		Isaac: A curved, organic, irregular cavern with random crooked alcoves!
		do GameManager.record_clue("angel", "building_slip", "Claims ideal living space is an irregular, crooked, curved cavern.")
		Isaac: Angles are overrated!
	else:
		Isaac: A perfectly cubic room constructed with 90-degree marble pillars and dual mirrored arches!
		Isaac: Absolute mathematical symmetry in every dimension!
	=> main_menu

~ end_date
Isaac: The allocated duration of 180 seconds has elapsed precisely. Farewell for now.
do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END
